*'''[[Mahamudu Bawumia]]''', incumbent [[Vice President of Ghana]]<ref name="npp-candidates"/><ref name="bawumiarun">{{cite news |last1=Dontoh |first1=Ekow |title=Ghana's Bawumia Will Run for President Next Year, Graphic Says |url=https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2023-05-04/ghana-s-bawumia-will-run-for-president-next-year-graphic-says#xj4y7vzkg |access-date=12 May 2023 |work=[[Bloomberg News|Bloomberg]] |date=4 May 2023 |language=en}}</ref>
