*[[Owusu Afriyie Akoto]], immediate former [[Ministry of Food and Agriculture (Ghana)|Minister for Food and Agriculture]]<ref>{{cite news |title=Farmers will vote for me to become NPP's 2024 flagbearer – Afriyie Akoto |url=https://citinewsroom.com/2023/05/farmers-will-vote-for-me-to-become-npps-2024-flagbearer-afriyie-akoto/ |work=Citi Newsroom |date=10 May 2023}}</ref>
